# R1117: another project's early architecture reference (13 R1-R24 markdown files).
#
# Plumb is an independent Java-only project inspired by Fathom, not a port of it, so these
# files document a codebase that is not this one. They stay on disk -- the docs/README.md
# and docs/archive/README.md both record them as a deliberate reference -- but they are not
# part of Plumb and do not belong in its history.
fathom-dfa/

